PENANCEMOD-PRE_EXECUTION_PREP.descriptio:
Draw cards until your hand is full. For each card drawn:
[gold]Attack[/gold]: gain 1 [gold]Judgment[/gold];
[gold]Skill[/gold]: gain 1 [gold]Thorn Aura[/gold];
[gold]Power[/gold]: gain 1 [gold]Strength[/gold];
[gold]Curse[/gold]: gain {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}.

PENANCEMOD-SCENE_INVESTIGATION.descripti:
When you play 2 cards of the same type in a row, gain a reward:
[gold]Attack[/gold] -> Random {IfUpgraded:show:Upgraded |}[gold]Skill[/gold];
[gold]Skill[/gold] -> Random {IfUpgraded:show:Upgraded |}[gold]Attack[/gold];
[gold]Power[/gold] -> {energyPrefix:energyIcons(2)}.
(Created cards [gold]Exhaust[/gold] and are [gold]Ethereal[/gold])

PENANCEMOD-TANGLED_THREADS.description:
Spend all {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}.
Randomly choose cards in your hand equal to the amount of {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)} spent. They cost 0 this combat.{IfUpgraded:show:
Refund {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}.|}
